+/**
+ * Choose a system whose frontier token to explore: exploreFront_&lt;tile&gt; (Empyrean hero) and probeStep2_&lt;tile&gt;
+ * (Exploration Probe action card, Circlet of the Void relic). Dark Energy Tap explores on its own when the tactical
