+/**
+ * The Ral Nel Consortium (Thunder's Edge). Agent (handleRalNelAgent_&lt;ac&gt; → handleRalNelAgentPt2_&lt;ac&gt;_&lt;faction&gt;),
+ * commander Watchful Ojz (ralnelCommander_&lt;pos&gt; retreat; ralnelCStep3_&lt;to&gt;_&lt;from&gt;; moveOjzRetreatS1_ /
+ * undoOjzRetreatS1_ &lt;from&gt;_&lt;unit&gt;_&lt;holder&gt;, ojzRetreatS2_&lt;from&gt;, ojzRetreatS3_&lt;to&gt;), Survival Instinct
+ * (startSurvival_&lt;active&gt;[_&lt;from&gt;], moveSurvival_ / undoSurvival_ &lt;active&gt;_&lt;from&gt;_&lt;unit&gt;_&lt;holder&gt;,
+ * finishSurvival_&lt;active&gt;), Miniaturization (miniLanding_&lt;pos&gt;_&lt;n&gt;pd|sd_&lt;planet&gt;,
+ * removeStrandedStructures_&lt;pos&gt;), mech Alarum (startForerunner_ / moveForerunner_ / undoForerunner_ /
+ * finishForerunner_, ralnelPull_&lt;pos&gt;_&lt;planet&gt;, ralnelMechPull_&lt;unit&gt;_&lt;from&gt;_&lt;to&gt;), Nanomachines
+ * (nanomachines_pds|actionCard|repair), Nano-Link Permit (startCourierTransport_&lt;pos&gt;,
+ * courierTransport_&lt;dest&gt;_&lt;adj&gt;_&lt;unit&gt;_&lt;holder&gt;_...) (Data Skimmer is te.breakthrough).
